  "question": {
    "text": "What is the <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> of <math><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> (salt of weak acid and strong base) at <math><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> ? (Given: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub></math> of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>)</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "For salt of weak acid and strong base;<br><math ><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> <math ><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br><math ><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br><math ><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0.5</mn></math><br><math ><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><br>So, <math ><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> <math ><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msup><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
